@@section 1
@@title SQ-MELT Melting system: salt, fire and lava melt ice and snow, 2026-11-14 ([melting.md](../melting.md) 7, [plan_bugfix_1114.md](../plan_bugfix_1114.md) 3.8, 5.1, 7.1; TODO `creativedelight/members #56`)
