## SQ-MELT-04 | blue ice beside salt steps blue -> packed -> ice -> water at the slow rate; packed by fire / lava ranges (randomTickSpeed 100, 5 min)
@group A
@commands Four Salt Blocks each touching one `minecraft:blue_ice`; sample every 20 s for 5 min (`execute if block`); packed ice touching fire and packed ice at distance 2 from fire; packed ice at 2 and at 3 from lava; wait 5 min
@pass blue ice steps blue -> packed -> ice -> water, never skipping a tier; step count over the window roughly `slowMeltChance` (0.05) x random ticks (about 1 in 20 of the melts the plain ice gets); packed beside fire stepped, at 2 from fire not; at 2 from lava stepped, at 3 not
@fails skipped tiers: `slowSteps`; no steps at all: blue/packed not random ticking (`extraRandomTickBlocks`)
@from batches/r1115/p3_a1.qb
